[[4,1,0,"<h3 class=\"step\" data-step=\"removing\" data-part=\"removal\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/20.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Removing</h3><a class=\"jump\" href=\"#\" data-jump=\"refitting\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/21.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Refitting</a><p>1. Position the cylinder head (1a) in the vice, using tools (1b), 1 (c) and 1(d).</p><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th><figure class=\"diagram\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/125000902.svg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></th><th><p>Name</p></th><th colspan=\"1\"><p>Country</p></th></tr><tr><td><p>1b</p></td><td><p>Mount</p></td><td colspan=\"1\"><p>1.820.012.000</p></td></tr></table></div><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th><figure class=\"diagram\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/125000902.svg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></th><th><p>Name</p></th><th colspan=\"1\"><p>Country</p></th></tr><tr><td><p>1c</p></td><td><p>Mount</p></td><td colspan=\"1\"><p>1.820.050.000</p></td></tr></table></div><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th><figure class=\"diagram\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/125000902.svg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></th><th><p>Name</p></th><th colspan=\"1\"><p>Country</p></th></tr><tr><td><p>1d</p></td><td><p>-</p></td><td colspan=\"1\"><p>1.860.952.000</p></td></tr></table></div><figure class=\"photo\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/125002719.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure>"],[4,1,0,"<p>1. Undo the nuts (1a) and remove the bracket on the engine for the reaction rod (1b).</p><figure class=\"photo\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/125002720.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure>"],[4,1,0,"<p>1. Undo the bolts (1a) and remove the camshaft caps (1b).</p><p>2. Remove the camshafts.</p><p>3. Remove the front camshaft oil seals.</p><figure class=\"photo\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/125002721.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure>"],[4,1,0,"<h3 class=\"step\" data-step=\"refitting\" data-part=\"refit\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/21.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Refitting</h3><a class=\"jump\" href=\"#\" data-jump=\"removing\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/20.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Removing</a><p>Place the camshafts back in their housings.</p><p>Place the camshaft caps back in their housings in the sequence shown in the diagram.</p><figure class=\"photo\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/125002722.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure>"],[4,1,0,"<p>Tighten the camshaft cap bolts to the specified torque.</p><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th><figure class=\"diagram\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/125000866.svg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></th><th><p>Fastening</p></th><th><p>Component</p></th><th><p>Ø</p></th><th colspan=\"1\"><p>Value</p><p>(daNm)</p></th></tr><tr><td><p>-</p></td><td><p>Bolt</p></td><td><p>CAMSHAFT CAPS/</p></td><td><p>M8</p></td><td colspan=\"1\"><p>(Cylinder head side) 1.8 ÷ 2.0</p></td></tr></table></div><p>1. Fit the camshaft front oil seals (1a) using the tool (1b).</p><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th><figure class=\"diagram\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/125000902.svg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></th><th><p>Name</p></th><th colspan=\"1\"><p>Country</p></th></tr><tr><td><p>1b</p></td><td><p>Fitting tool</p></td><td colspan=\"1\"><p>1.860.948.000</p></td></tr></table></div><figure class=\"photo\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/125002723.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure>"],[4,1,0,"<p>1. Fit the bracket on the engine for the reaction rod (1a) and fix it tightening the nuts (1b) to the recommended torque.</p><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th><figure class=\"diagram\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/125000866.svg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></th><th><p>Fastening</p></th><th><p>Component</p></th><th><p>Ø</p></th><th colspan=\"1\"><p>Value</p><p>(daNm)</p></th></tr><tr><td><p>1b</p></td><td><p>Nut</p></td><td><p>REACTION LINK BRACKET ON ENGINE</p></td><td><p>M10</p></td><td colspan=\"1\"><p>(Cylinder head side) 4.5 ÷ 5.5</p></td></tr></table></div><figure class=\"photo\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/125002724.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure>"],[4,1,0,"<p>Remove the cylinder head from the supporting tools.</p>"]]